###! V-01 List pending verifications
GET {{host}}/api/verifications?status=PENDING&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}

###! V-01 List approved verifications
GET {{host}}/api/verifications?status=APPROVED&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}

### V-01 List rejected verifications
GET {{host}}/api/verifications?status=REJECTED&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}

###! V-02Get verification detail
GET {{host}}/api/verifications/{{verificationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}

### V-03 Approve a verification
PATCH {{host}}/api/verifications/{{verificationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "APPROVED"
}

### V-03 Reject a verification with reason
PATCH {{host}}/api/verifications/{{verificationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "REJECTED",
  "reason": "Aadhaar details could not be verified"
}

### V-03 Invalid status -> 400
PATCH {{host}}/api/verifications/{{verificationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PENDING"
}

### Non-police cannot list verifications -> 403
GET {{host}}/api/verifications?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{seniorToken}}